1
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:09,451
In twenty twenty-six, I built a way back to the Moon.
2026 年，我做了这个游戏，想再回一次月球。

2
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:13,849
I wanted somewhere quiet enough to see home.
我想找个安静的地方，回头看看家。

3
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:20,550
Though my soul may set in darkness,
纵使我的灵魂沉入黑暗，

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,935
it will rise in perfect light.
它终将在澄澈的光中升起。

5
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:31,593
I have loved the stars too truly
我如此真切地爱过繁星，

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,007
to be fearful of the night.
又怎会畏惧黑夜。

7
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:52,207
Everyone I love lives on that fleck of blue.
我爱的人，都住在那一点蓝色里。

8
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:58,449
Look down. A footprint in the dust.
低头看。月尘里，有一枚脚印。

9
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:05,346
It took thousands of hands to leave that one mark.
留下这一枚脚印，靠的是千千万万双手。

10
00:01:09,250 --> 00:01:10,798
Ready? Let go.
准备好了？松手。

11
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:20,925
Once, the whole world leaned toward a little screen.
曾经，全世界的人都凑近了一方小小的荧屏。

12
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:27,159
I came back for that feeling.
我想找回的，就是那种在一起的感觉。

13
00:01:31,700 --> 00:01:35,360
I still believe we can go farther together.
我依然相信，我们可以一起走得更远。

14
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:39,212
Columbia, Eagle. Are you still there?
哥伦比亚号，这里是鹰号。你还在吗？

15
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:46,497
Still here, Eagle.
我一直都在，鹰号。

16
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:51,988
I left the light on for you.
我给你们留着灯。

17
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:02,093
Columbia, this is Eagle. We have you in sight.
哥伦比亚号，这里是鹰号。我们看见你了。

18
00:02:09,250 --> 00:02:10,585
Hard dock.
对接锁定。

19
00:02:11,050 --> 00:02:13,260
Welcome back aboard.
欢迎归舱。

20
00:02:18,350 --> 00:02:22,075
From our blue Earth, we sail into eternity.
以蓝色出发，驶向永恒。
